:solution
$()We have 
!insmath g($val35)=$val36
$(), therefore	<p>
!insmath h'($val35) = f '(g($val35)) g'($val35)	= f '($val36) g'($val35) = $val38 \times $val39 = $val40
$().	</p>	
$()
